"[[quarkus-vertx-core_quarkus.vertx.growth-resistance]]`link:#quarkus-vertx-"
"core_quarkus.vertx.growth-resistance[quarkus.vertx.growth-resistance]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The executor growth resistance. A resistance factor applied after the core "
"pool is full; values applied here will cause that fraction of submissions to "
"create new threads when no idle thread is available. A value of `0.0f` "
"implies that threads beyond the core size should be created as aggressively "
"as threads within it; a value of `1.0f` implies that threads beyond the core "
"size should never be created.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:"
"+++QUARKUS_VERTX_GROWTH_RESISTANCE+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"[[quarkus-vertx-core_quarkus.vertx.growth-resistance]]`link:#quarkus-vertx-"
"core_quarkus.vertx.growth-resistance[quarkus.vertx.growth-resistance]`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The executor growth resistance. A resistance factor applied after the core "
"pool is full; values applied here will cause that fraction of submissions to "
"create new threads when no idle thread is available. A value of `0.0f` "
"implies that threads beyond the core size should be created as aggressively "
"as threads within it; a value of `1.0f` implies that threads beyond the core "
"size should never be created."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:"
"+++QUARKUS_VERTX_GROWTH_RESISTANCE+++[]"
